# Netlify redirects file — only read if the site is hosted on Netlify.
# Ignored by every other host; harmless to leave in place otherwise.
#
# Force a single canonical host (apex -> www) to avoid duplicate indexing
# of https://vidhicorplegal.com/... and https://www.vidhicorplegal.com/...
# as two separate URLs. Enable "Force HTTPS" separately in Netlify's
# Domain settings — that part isn't controlled by this file.
https://vidhicorplegal.com/*  https://www.vidhicorplegal.com/:splat  301!

